ate:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-30T21:26:52-08:00","id":1041095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1040309-what-do-you-want-out-of-dark-eras-2?p=1041093#post1041093\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A friend of mine who majored in history came up with a list of, like, four of five really awesome ideas. I'll bug him again about it tomorrow.</div> </div> </div> </div> Given that I majored in Islamic History, the more I see of it in Dark Eras, the happier I will be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-30T21:59:38-08:00","id":1041105,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gullinbursti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1040309-what-do-you-want-out-of-dark-eras-2?p=1041083#post1041083\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh, didn't know that was confirmed in DE2. Just made my day Bunyip <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Are you calling the DE Companion DE2? It's creating confusion for me. <br /> <br /> The DEC is written and working its way through the process as per the Monday Meeting Notes. DE2 is something I believe Rich and Rose have said OPP are planning, after the success of DE and the massive interest it has generated.<br /> <br /> Forsaken By Rome is in the DEC. The rules for making Pure chatacters that appear in it have already been spoiled by Stew.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","user":"Bunyip","date":". 01-31-2017, 01:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-30T23:10:50-08:00","id":1041118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1040309-what-do-you-want-out-of-dark-eras-2?p=1041105#post1041105\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Are you calling the DE Companion DE2? It's creating confusion for me.<br /> <br /> The DEC is written and working its way through the process as per the Monday Meeting Notes. DE2 is something I believe Rich and Rose have said OPP are planning, after the success of DE and the massive interest it has generated.<br /> <br /> Forsaken By Rome is in the DEC. The rules for making Pure chatacters that appear in it have already been spoiled by Stew.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apologies, I meant the Companion :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-31T05:22:17-08:00","id":1041207,"title":"","content":"I agree with you on all points <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4433_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4433\" data-vbnamecard=\"4433\">Second Chances</a>. Being in South East Asia, I would love to see more hot spots beyond Europe (not that I mind Europe).<br /> <br /> Here's my wish list:<br /> \u200b<br /> <b>Rodrigo Borgia Rome</b><br /> Clandestine Lancea et Sanctum and Invictus politicking during the splendiforous reign of the worldy Pope Alexander V. French invasion, Milanese aspirations, jealous cardinals, wild-eyed monks, and papal mistresses.<br /> <br /> <b>The era of Charles V and Suleiman the Magnificent</b><br /> It's a titanic showdown between two 'Defenders of the Faith' as they vie for the soul of Europe while consolidating their grand empires. Fortresses are sacked, and Martin Luther's Reformation runs rampant. In the midst of chaos, Hunters question their allegiances, and turn on each other - Catholic vs Protestant vs Muslim.<br /> <br /> <b>Haitian Revolution</b><br /> Latin America's first independence movement and modern history's largest slave uprising is the backdrop to the fleeting, combustive alliances with the Haitian Freehold. Here the Gentry take on French, African, and Vodou flavors.<br /> <br /> <b>Japanese Occupation of the Philippines and the Liberation of Manila</b><br /> The Imperial Army invades the then-American colony hours after Pearl Harbor. Includes the Battle of Corregidor, the Bataan Death March, and the tragic Liberation of Manila. The Exarch of War reigns, while Manila's Awakened fight a losing battle to preserve the city. When the smoke clears, Manila will become the second most devastated city of World War II.<br /> <br /> <b>Iranian Revolution of '78-79</b><br /> Argo from a Promethean perspective. Angry mobs, the clash of Westernization with Islamic piety, and the return of Khomeini all while the Created desperately seek to understand the human experiences of love, faith, and sacrifice. Elsewhere the Arisen attempt to reclaim forgotten relics across modern Persia.<br /> <br /> <b>Hong Kong 1997</b><br /> Britain returns the port of Hong Kong to China. The transition may be peaceful, but not for the island's Kindred. Tempers flare when local vampires, used to running their own affairs, must now accept overlords in Beijing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4260,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4260-terpsichordean","user":"terpsichordean","date":". 01-31-2017, 08:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4260-terpsichordean","name":"terpsichordean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4260_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"79"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-31T08:16:30-08:00","id":1041269,"title":"","content":"Reeeaallly want a larger Muslim-majority area that focuses more on the people in it. Mummy was all well and good, except for that you play as outsiders, and the game is even more founded in pre-Islam Egypt. I want a setting that explores the bredth and depth of the Mesopotamian mixing pot. Geist/Mage/Changeling 8th-10th century Baghdad/Samarra would be fun. I've heard Demons in Istanbul as a great idea as well. Vampire Mamluk Jerusalem could be fun (offering the devs a new opportunity to get better Muslim covenants). <br /> Terpsichordean's Promethean/Mummy Iranian Revolution is brilliant, I love it. Sybaris + Disquiet works so well for eras such as this. <br /> Would also be good to have a 19th-20th century mid-colonialism era. French Morocco would be an interesting place, for example, not sure what line I would run it with though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2291-gwyn-chan-r-gwyll","name":"Gwyn chan 'r Gwyll","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-31T09:56:32-08:00","id":1041315,"title":"","content":"Isn't the demon one already an Era in the initial book? (I don't have it on me sorry).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-31T10:00:29-08:00","id":1041317,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gullinbursti</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1040309-what-do-you-want-out-of-dark-eras-2?p=1041315#post1041315\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Isn't the demon one already an Era in the initial book? (I don't have it on me sorry).</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. Technically Constantinople. As we should all know, Istanbul was Constantinople, now it's Istanbul, not Constantinople.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"use